sequenceDiagram
    participant UserA as User_A_Browser
    participant UserB as User_B_Browser
    participant WS as WebSocket_Handler
    participant RM as Room_Manager
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over RM,DB: Room Load
    RM->>DB: Load Yjs snapshot for roomId
    DB-->>RM: Binary state (or empty)
    RM->>RM: Apply state to Y.Doc

    Note over UserA,WS: User A Joins
    UserA->>WS: Connect /ws/collab/roomId
    WS->>RM: joinRoom(roomId, socketA)
    RM-->>UserA: Sync Step 1 (full state)

    Note over UserA,RM: User A Creates Sticky Note
    UserA->>UserA: Click canvas with sticky-note tool
    UserA->>UserA: Insert into local Y.Doc elements map
    UserA->>WS: Yjs update (binary)
    WS->>RM: Apply update to server Y.Doc
    RM->>UserB: Broadcast update
    UserB->>UserB: Apply update, re-render

    Note over UserA,RM: User A Moves Element
    UserA->>UserA: Drag element (Konva draggable)
    UserA->>UserA: Update x,y in Y.Doc on dragEnd
    UserA->>WS: Yjs update (binary)
    WS->>RM: Apply update to server Y.Doc
    RM->>UserB: Broadcast update
    UserB->>UserB: Apply update, element moves

    Note over UserA,UserB: Real-time Cursors
    UserA->>UserA: Move mouse on canvas
    UserA->>UserA: Update presence Y.Map with cursor coords
    UserA->>WS: Yjs update (presence)
    WS->>RM: Apply to server Y.Doc
    RM->>UserB: Broadcast update
    UserB->>UserB: Render remote cursor

    Note over RM,DB: Periodic Persistence
    RM->>RM: Every 30s timer fires
    RM->>DB: Save Y.encodeStateAsUpdate()

    Note over RM,DB: Last User Disconnects
    RM->>DB: Save final Y.Doc state
    RM->>RM: Dispose room from memory
